			"notes": "Added Configs for Litematica:\n* materialListIgnoreBlockState\n* renderHeldItemOnly\n\nAdded Configs for Tweakeroo:\n* gridRestrictX\n* gridRestrictY\n* gridRestrictZ\n* disableSleepingNotification\n* disableSnowLayerStacking\n* disableStuckArrowsRendering\n* tweakFlexibleBlockPlacementAdjacentToggle\n* tweakFlexibleBlockPlacementOffsetToggle\n* tweakMovementHold\n* tweakNameTagPiglins\n\n**Any other changes or additions for this release can be found by looking through the [diff for the wiki](https://github.com/hp3721/masaadditions/wiki/_compare/9ba821390fc2bca4032100267d3213bd0c163eb6...a35ad618cb39741750d5f729796ab2c6a295d7a4).**"
