			"notes": "Added Configs:\n* cloudHeight\n* handRestockContinuous\n* skyTimeOverride\n* windowTitleOverride\n* preventAttackEntitiesList\n* disableBedExplosions\n* disableBlockAttackedParticles\n* disableFarmlandMaking\n* disableFootstepParticles\n* disableHoneyBlockSlowdown\n* disableHoneyBlockJumping\n* disableOtherPlayerRendering\n* disablePathMaking\n* disablePlantBlockModelOffset\n* tweakAlwaysRenderBarrierParticles\n* tweakForceSwapGear\n* tweakLlamaSteering\n* tweakOverrideWindowTitle\n* tweakPreventAttackEntities\n* tweakRainbowLeaves\n* tweakOverrideSkyTime\n\nAdditional Features:\n* Fixes `disableSlimeBlockSlowdown` not working properly whenever restarting the client after toggling them. See this [GitHub issue](https://github.com/maruohon/malilib/issues/25) for more info.\n    * The same hack-fix is used to ensure this add-on's `disableHoneyBlockSlowdown` and `disableHoneyBlockJumping` features work properly whenever restarting the client after toggling them.\n* Removes the unused `Placement stuff` tab button in the [Tweakeroo](https://github.com/maruohon/tweakeroo/tree/fabric_1.16_temp_features) menu.\n* Hides the potion warnings for water breathing, when using `tweakPotionWarning`, if the player is wearing a turtle helmet. See this [GitHub issue](https://github.com/maruohon/tweakeroo/issues/10) for more info.\n\n**Any other changes or additions for this release can be found by looking through the [diff for the wiki](https://github.com/hp3721/masaadditions/wiki/TweakerooAdditions/_compare/f7a09a17f227a87c6c1ccd810973723bac6b205c...9ba821390fc2bca4032100267d3213bd0c163eb6).**"
		},
